  <running_head>ANIMADVERSIONES.</running_head>
  <main_text>
    <l n="1" para="true">§ 2. Atqui eft tertia quædam natura,</l>
    <l n="2">communis tam fimilaribus, quam diffi-</l>
    <l n="3">milaribus, Vnio feu continuitas, Ergo</l>
    <l n="4">erit tertium morborum genus.</l>
    <l n="5" para="true">§ 3. Quemadmodum igitur partes fi-</l>
    <l n="6">milares funt unæ,continuæve, unamque</l>
    <l n="7">actionem edunt; quemadmodum diffi-</l>
    <l n="8">milares funt unæ,continuæve, unamque</l>
    <l n="9">actionem perfectam edunt : ita unitate</l>
    <l n="10">illâ folutâ,utrinque fit morbus, qui Vni-</l>
    <l n="11">tatis feu Continui folutio dicitur.</l>
    <l n="12" para="true">§ 4. Cæterum, quia unum multis</l>
    <l n="13">modis dicitur, s.Metaph.8. ne qua de-</l>
    <l n="14">ceptio oriatur, feligere fas eft nobis V-</l>
    <l n="15">num illud, quod huc facit. Id verò eft,</l>
    <l n="16">cum ex duobus extremis fit unum.</l>
    <l n="17" para="true">§ 5. Hoc cum fiat tam ab arte, quam</l>
    <l n="18">à naturâ : relinquamus illud, accepte-</l>
    <l n="19">mus hoc.</l>
    <l n="20" para="true">§ 6. Vnum ergò,aut, fi mavis,Conti-</l>
    <l n="21">nuum Naturâ eftid, cujus motus eftu-</l>
    <l n="22">nus, tempore indivifibilis.</l>
    <l n="23" para="true">§ 7. Hæc definitio licet fitâ pofterio-</l>
    <l n="24">ri,ut Monlorius habet tract. de Vniverf.</l>
    <l n="25">quadrat tamen rebus noftris, fi rectè ac-</l>
    <l n="26">commodetur,</l>
    <l n="27" para="true">§ 8. Accommodatio eft,ut dicamus,</l>
    <l n="28">Vnum &amp; continuum modò diftingui,</l>
    <l n="29">modò non. Diftinctio eft, Vnum feu</l>
    <l n="30">Continuum aliud eft verè tale, id vid;</l>
    <l n="31">cujus</l>
  </main_text>
  <notes />
